CHAPTER.VERS:
He says to them, But who do you

          {+}
         say that I am?

Truly I say to you

          {+}
        , there are some of those who stand here, who will in no way taste of death, until they see the Son of Man coming in his kingdom.

While he was yet speaking, look, a bright cloud overshadowed them: and look, a voice out of the cloud, saying, This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased; hear

          {+}
         him.

But I say to you

          {+}
        , that Elijah has come, and they have also done to him whatever they would, even as it is written of him.
